amage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Pit%20Reaver\"><img alt=\"Pit Reaver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pit_Reaver_74f19d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Pit%20Reaver\">Pit Reaver</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,350</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">257+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Pit%20Scourge\"><img alt=\"Pit Scourge\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pit_Scourge_7e56ef.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Pit%20Scourge\">Pit Scourge</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Pit%20Destroyer\"><img alt=\"Pit Destroyer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pit_Destroyer_0b9364.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Pit%20Destroyer\">Pit Destroyer</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">297+</td><td style=\"font